# MQTT topic permissions, matched by username.
# Unlisted users/topics have no access. Keep allow_anonymous false in the broker.
# These names match .env.example and the current broker accounts.

# Laptop BLE gateway: sensor producer, feedback recipient and latency initiator.
user laptop_cli
topic write fb/sensor/raw
topic read ultra96/ai/haptics
topic read phone/handedness
topic read sys/ultra96/status
topic readwrite latency/laptop/req
topic readwrite latency/laptop/resp
topic write latency/ultra96/req
topic write latency/phone/req

# Ultra96: sensor/handedness consumer, inference and haptic producer.
user ultra96
topic read fb/sensor/raw
topic read phone/handedness
topic write ultra96/ai/results
topic write ultra96/ai/haptics
topic write sys/ultra96/status
topic read latency/ultra96/req
topic write latency/laptop/resp

# Phone: sensor/result consumer, retained handedness producer and latency echo.
user phone
topic read fb/sensor/raw
topic read ultra96/ai/results
topic read sys/ultra96/status
topic write phone/handedness
topic read latency/phone/req
topic write latency/laptop/resp
